{"id":"84940566355062f6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"句法算术层级与 PA 等价闭包","display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 句法算术层级与 PA 等价闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","91-df-arith-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 句法算术层级与 PA 等价闭包","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</span><span>91-df-arith-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 句法算术层级与 PA 等价闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BndFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{BndFml}\\)</span> 是仅含有界量词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 公式类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 使用该有限原始递归定义扩展。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\)</span> 是有界矩阵、至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个交替无界量词块、首块分别存在/全称的前束公式类，允许加入无作用量词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 列出所比公式的自由变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}},\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}},\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\)</span> 为句法类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 为下述 PA 等价闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{BndFml},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\quad\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{BndFml},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\quad\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)]\\},\n\\quad\\Pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)]\\},\n\\quad\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)]\\},\n\\quad\\Pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)]\\},\n\\quad\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>区分递归判定的前束句法类与“有 PA 等价证明”的闭包，后者的成员测试需要搜索证明，不能直接当成原始递归句法谓词。\n每个固定复杂度的基础语言片段可有算术部分真理定义，不需要先加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个真理谓词；不能有一个算术定义覆盖全部基础真理。有限 PR 函数扩张可能改变最低有界层的具体句法复杂度，比较时须固定语言。\n标准 PA 可证性可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> 表示，一致性句可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span> 表示。新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 不属于基础算术语言，不是仅凭其符号名称就具某个更高的算术层级。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1–§6 的算术与部分真理背景；Theorem 7.5 的部分真理替换；本节点明确区分句法类及 PA 等价约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BndFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}},\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{BndFml},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\quad\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\quad(n\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)]\\},\n\\quad\\Pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\ [\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)]\\},\n\\quad\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^